\"color:#c9d2c9\"><span class=\"style-terminal-cursor\"></span></span></span>\n    </span>","parts":[{"key":"mono","cn":"等宽字体","en":"Monospace","desc":"用于命令、路径和数据对齐；长正文不必强制使用","desc_en":"Used for command, path and data alignment; not mandatory for long bodies"},{"key":"ink","cn":"克制色板","en":"Palette","desc":"以少量基础色突出输出状态，同时保证对比度和状态含义","desc_en":"Use a small amount of basic colors to highlight the output status while ensuring contrast and status meaning."},{"key":"prompt","cn":"$ 提示符","en":"Prompt","desc":"提示符可标明命令上下文；关键操作、状态和错误仍需文字或稳定图标","desc_en":"Prompts indicate command context; key operations, status, and errors still require text or stable icons"},{"key":"ascii","cn":"ASCII 分隔线","en":"ASCII Divider","desc":"────── ┤标题├ ──────,字符代替图形分隔","desc_en":"────── ┤Title├ ──────, characters replace graphic separation"},{"key":"cursor","cn":"闪烁光标","en":"Blink Cursor","desc":"可作为装饰性运行提示；不要持续干扰阅读，并支持减少动效","desc_en":"Can be used as a decorative running prompt; do not continue to interfere with reading, and support reducing animation effects"}]},"use":[{"t":"命令行工具官网，让网页延续产品语言","m":"style-terminal-use-cli"},{"t":"开发者文档首页，强调目录和命令示例","m":"style-terminal-use-doc"},{"t":"API 与云服务页面，展示状态和技术信息","m":"style-terminal-use-api"},{"t":"工程团队招聘页，面向熟悉命令行的受众","m":"style-terminal-use-hire"}],"dont":[{"t":"面向非技术用户却不解释终端符号","m":"style-terminal-dont-all","bad":true},{"t":"暗色背景配低对比、小字号正文","m":"style-terminal-dont-small","bad":true},{"t":"把命令做成图片，导致无法复制和搜索","m":"style-terminal-dont-fake","bad":true},{"t":"同时加入大量不相关的玻璃和拟物材质","m":"style-terminal-dont-mix","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"等宽字体用于命令、数据和短标签，长正文保持易读","m":"style-terminal-mono"},{"t":"建立克制的基础色，让命令内容始终清楚","m":"style-terminal-single"},{"t":"提示符和状态符号只用于帮助识别结构","m":"style-terminal-prompt"},{"t":"ASCII 分隔线可以组织内容，但不能增加阅读负担","m":"style-terminal-ascii"},{"t":"闪烁光标只作轻量提示，并响应减少动效设置","m":"style-terminal-cursor"}],"prompt":"做一个部署观察控制台，帮助工程师查看服务健康状态、灰度发布进度，并提供继续发布或回滚入口。命令和日志要能复制、搜索和阅读，状态不能只靠颜色表达。这次只实现界面，不执行真实发布或回滚；真实操作必须先确认授权、目标环境和当前状态。","prompt_en":"Terminal-style deployment console, monospace type, black background with restrained green text, shell prompt and command history, service health, canary deployment, promote and rollback tasks, ASCII dividers and subtle reduced-motion cursor","scenes":["部署观察控制台","AI CLI 工具官网","开发者文档首页","API 产品落地页","工程师招聘页"],"en":{"prompt":"Terminal-style deployment console, monospace type, black background with restrained green text, shell prompt and command history, service health, canary deployment, promote and rollback tasks, ASCII dividers and subtle reduced-motion cursor","use":[{"t":"Command-line tool website","m":"style-terminal-use-cli"},{"t":"Developer documentation","m":"style-terminal-use-doc"},{"t":"API or cloud-service page","m":"style-terminal-use-api"},{"t":"Engineering recruitment page","m":"style-terminal-use-hire"}],"dont":[{"t":"Assume non-technical visitors understand every terminal symbol","m":"style-terminal-dont-all","bad":true},{"t":"Use low-contrast small text on a dark surface","m":"style-terminal-dont-small","bad":true},{"t":"Turn commands into images that cannot be copied","m":"style-terminal-dont-fake","bad":true},{"t":"Mix many unrelated glass and realistic effects into the same system","m":"style-terminal-dont-mix","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Use monospace for commands, data, and short labels","m":"style-terminal-mono"},{"t":"Keep long explanations in a comfortable reading style","m":"style-terminal-single"},{"t":"Use prompts and status symbols to clarify structure","m":"style-terminal-prompt"},{"t":"Treat ASCII dividers as organization rather than decoration","m":"style-terminal-ascii"},{"t":"Keep cursor animation subtle and respect reduced-motion settings","m":"style-terminal-cursor"}],"scenes":["CLI product","Developer docs","API service","Engineering careers","Cloud dashboard"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-terminal-scene\"><div class=\"tm-scene-head\"><b>▣ release/console</b><span>prod · ap-east-1</span><i>09:42:18</i></div><div class=\"tm-scene-grid\"><section><small>DEPLOYMENT #8842</small><h3>checkout-api <em>v2.14.0</em></h3><p>canary 25% · p95 stable · error rate 0.08%</p><div>$ deploy promote --to=100%</div><b>promote →</b><span>rollback ↶</span></section><aside><small>SERVICE STATUS</small><b>● api&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; healthy</b><b>● worker healthy</b><b class=\"tm-warn\">● web&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 warning</b><pre>✓ canary healthy\n… awaiting approval</pre></aside></div></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #1e241e;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #1e241e\">\n        <span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff5f56\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffbd2e\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#27c93f\"></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b;margin-left:6px\">vibe-cli.dev</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:24px 26px 22px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b;margin-bottom:22px\">\n          <b style=\"color:#f2f5f2\">vibe▮</b><span>Fictional example · docs · pricing</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;color:#f2f5f2;letter-spacing:1px\">Use natural language to put ideas online<span class=\"style-terminal-cursor\"></span></div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b;margin:12px 0 16px;line-height:1.8\">Describe the page you want, AI will generate the code and deploy it. <br>No dragging, no panels, just one line of commands. </p>\n        <div style=\"background:#111411;color:#d9e5d9;border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> npx vibe init</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b\">⌘C copy</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:18px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b\">\n          <span>Fictional demo data</span>\n          <span>Status labels are examples</span>\n          <span>Link monitoring source</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #1e241e;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;display:flex\">\n      <div style=\"width:168px;flex:none;border-right:1px solid #1e241e;padding:14px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:2.1\">\n        <div style=\"color:#6b7a6b\">──┤ Start ├─────</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#4af626\">▸ Get started quickly</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">Installation</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">First project</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#6b7a6b;margin-top:8px\">──┤ command ├─────</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">vibe init</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">vibe deploy</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:16px 20px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#c9d2c9\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#f2f5f2\"># Get started quickly</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#6b7a6b;margin:6px 0 10px\">Example of installation and deployment steps</div>\n        <div style=\"background:#111411;color:#d9e5d9;border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> npm i -g vibe-cli</div>\n        <div style=\"background:#111411;color:#d9e5d9;border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> vibe init my-app <span style=\"color:#6b7a6b\"># Choose a template</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:#111411;color:#d9e5d9;border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px\"><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> vibe deploy <span style=\"color:#6b7a6b\"># ✓ https://my-app.vibe.app</span></div>\n        <div style=\"color:#6b7a6b;margin-top:10px\">Tip: The command should support copying and searching, and should not be presented only as a screenshot. </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #1e241e;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;padding:22px 26px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <b style=\"color:#f2f5f2\">echo.api</b><span>status: <span style=\"color:#4af626\">Example status ●</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;color:#f2f5f2;letter-spacing:1px\">One API for multiple models</div>\n      <div style=\"background:#111411;color:#d9e5d9;border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;margin:16px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n        <div><span style=\"color:#6b7a6b\">POST</span> <span style=\"color:#c9d2c9\">/v1/chat/completions</span></div>\n        <div style=\"color:#6b7a6b\">{ \"model\": <span style=\"color:#4af626\">\"auto\"</span>, \"messages\": […] }</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#4af626\">→ Success · Example latency · Example cost</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:12px\">\n        <span style=\"border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:4px;padding:6px 12px;color:#c9d2c9\">Trial terms</span>\n        <span style=\"border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:4px;padding:6px 12px;color:#c9d2c9\">Billing</span>\n        <span style=\"border:1px solid #1e241e;border-radius:4px;padding:6px 12px;color:#6b7a6b\">Subscription terms</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #1e241e;margin-top:18px;padding-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b\">──────┤ Fictional example · Link status data to its monitoring source ├───────</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #1e241e;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;padding:22px 26px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b;margin-bottom:14px\">──────┤ man 1 hiring ├──────</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:#c9d2c9\">\n        <div><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> whoami</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">→ Backend Engineer · Work arrangements and pay are listed in the job posting</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> cat requirements.txt</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">→ Demonstrated hands-on engineering experience</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">→ Able to understand, maintain, and improve an existing codebase</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b968b\">→ Work arrangements are listed in the job posting</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span style=\"color:#4af626\">$</span> ./apply --with github</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#4af626\">→ Submit the materials listed in the job posting<span class=\"style-terminal-cursor\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"]},"usageMocks":{"style-terminal-use-cli":"<div style=\"width:100%;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#d7ddd7\">$ npx create-ai-app</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b;margin-top:4px\">CLI 工具官网可沿用命令行的内容线索</span></div>","style-terminal-use-doc":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">docs/ ├─ quickstart.md └─ api.md</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">文档站用等宽字体,目录都像命令输出</span></div>","style-terminal-use-api":"<div style=\"width:100%;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7a6b\">POST /v1/chat</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#4af626;margin-top:4px\">成功响应 · 示例延迟</span></div>","style-terminal-use-hire":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">$ whoami → 后端工程师(远程)</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">可表达工程文化，岗位与投递信息仍需直接</span></div>","style-terminal-dont-all":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">家庭相册应用也使用黑底绿字</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">非技术场景可能难以从该风格中获得任务线索</span></div>","style-terminal-dont-small":"<div style=\"width:100%;background:#0b0d0b;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d5c3d;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">暗绿配黑底,字号再一缩,内容难以识别</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">需同时检查字号、行高和颜色对比</span>","style-terminal-dont-fake":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">首屏放置终端截图，文字无法选择或搜索</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">命令应保留为可复制、可搜索的真实文字</span></div>","style-terminal-dont-mix":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:#0b0d0b;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;color:#4af626;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">$ run</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a18cd1,#fbc2eb);color:#fff\">毛玻璃气泡</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">无关材质会模糊命令、状态和任务的关系</span>"}}}